<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Freddie Mac said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Freddie Mac said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber raised its rating on Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp to buy from attractive, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
</text>
